      "id": 3,
      "claim": "Downloading a ROM from an unauthorized source constitutes copyright infringement, even if the user owns a physical copy of the game.",
      "evidence": "Copyright law grants the rights holder exclusive reproduction rights. Downloading a file is an act of reproduction. While creating a backup from one's own cartridge is a legal gray area (often permitted for personal use in some jurisdictions), downloading a copy from the internet is an unauthorized reproduction/distribution by a third party, which is illegal.",
